Description: Provides an R interface to the 'DGIdb' GraphQL API. The package
    supports queries for drugs, genes, drug-gene interactions and their claim
    types, gene categories, DGIdb data sources, and Drugs@FDA application data.
    It enables access to current DGIdb data for integration into R and
    Bioconductor workflows.
